; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 18. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'dm3E_intro'
dm3E_intro.dialogstring_05FA59! `[DEF]A mysterious garden floats[N]in the sky above Nazca.[FIN][DEF]Far below, Neil and the[N]others look no bigger than[N]grains of rice.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sg4C_spirits'
sg4C_spirits.dialogstring_05F371! `[CLD][BOR:8][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1A]Moon Tribe: We meet[N]again, huh? Mweheheheh.[WAI][N]We have watched kingdoms[N]rise, prosper, and crumble[N]beneath this garden.[WAI][N]We watched the Incas fall.[N]They were not the first,[N]nor were they the last.[END]`
sg4C_spirits.dialogstring_05F3C9! `[BOR:8][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1A]Race of the Moon: This[N]mid-air garden is our[N]vehicle.[FIN]Four crystal balls are[N]enshrined in the four[N]areas.[FIN]Go around clockwise and[N]you can get them all.[N]Mweheheheh…[END]`
sg4C_spirits.dialogstring_05F46E! `[CLD][BOR:8][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1A]Moon Tribe: The garden has[N]two faces.[WAI][N]Leap from the edge and you[N]may land on the world[N]beneath the one you see.[WAI][N]Up and down are only[N]a question of where[N]you stand.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sg52_switch'
sg52_switch.dialogstring_05F71C! `[DEF][CLD][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]This tile makes a sound[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sg55_mystic_statue'
sg55_mystic_statue.dialogstring_0ACF0E! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]After defeating the huge[N]bird, you found a Mystic[N]Statue in its corpse!![END]`
sg55_mystic_statue.dialogstring_0ACF4A! `[DEF]Through the roar of a[N]propeller, Neil's voice[N]booms from a megaphone![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Will! You're[N]getting too close to the[N]ground![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I'll catch you with the[N]aeroplane. Now jump![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sp58_missed_flight'
sp58_missed_flight.dialogstring_06805C! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Shoot! I missed![FIN][CLD][BOR:2][DLG:3,6][SIZ:C,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Neil, you idiot![N]Will's going to die![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Neil! There's still[N]time. Turn around![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Right! I'll get him[N]this time![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sp58_red_eye'
sp58_red_eye.dialogstring_068230! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: That was dangerous…[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: *Sniffle* *Sniffle*[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: *Sob* *Sob* *Sob*[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Kara and Erik, stop[N]cryin'. We saved Will,[N]after all.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: By the waaay,[N]Neil's amazing, isn't he?[N]Having made a thing like[N]this.[FIN][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Haha. Please don't[N]praise me like that.[N]Anyway, I'll take you to[N]the next ruin with this.[FIN]If we go by the precedent[N]of the ruins mapping up to[N]the shape of the[N]constellation of Cygnus,[FIN]…the next ruin should be[N]the continent of Mu.[END]`
sp58_red_eye.dialogstring_06834A! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Alright, out to the[N]ocean…!![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]The continent of Mu should[N]be sleeping somewhere in[N]this deep blue sea.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sp58_monologue'
sp58_monologue.dialogstring_0683EB! `[DEF]Will and the others barely[N]escaped from the aeroplane[N]in time[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Neil's a great inventor,[N]but every machine he[N]builds seems to be[N]missing one little thing.)[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](I guess nobody's perfect.[N]Not even Neil.)[END]`
